title: Relations With the Army
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: party_affairs
view-if: time >= relations_with_the_army_available_time
card-image: img/tsk.jpg
on-arrival: {! AnatolianCardActions.begin(this, 'relations_with_the_army'); !}

= Relations With the Army

We can speak privately with our contacts in the General Staff, or answer the accusations against us in public.

- @connections: Use our connections with the General Staff to ease the worries of the army
- @statements: Make statements against the slanders made to us
- @decline: No, we will not do any of these
- @navigation_return_main: Return

@connections
choose-if: resources >= 1
subtitle: Spend 1 Resource to reduce TSK pressure by up to 2 points.
unavailable-subtitle: Requires 1 Resource.
on-arrival: {! AnatolianCardActions.commit(Q); Q.relations_with_the_army_available_time = Q.time + (Q.rubicon_mode ? 4 : 2); Q.coup_timer = Math.max(0, Q.coup_timer - 2); !} resources -= 1; month_actions += 1
go-to: post_event

@statements
subtitle: Reduce TSK pressure by up to 1 point at no cost.
on-arrival: {! AnatolianCardActions.commit(Q); Q.relations_with_the_army_available_time = Q.time + (Q.rubicon_mode ? 4 : 2); Q.coup_timer = Math.max(0, Q.coup_timer - 1); !} month_actions += 1
go-to: post_event

@decline
subtitle: Discard this card and advance a turn.
on-arrival: {! AnatolianCardActions.commit(Q); Q.relations_with_the_army_available_time = Q.time + (Q.rubicon_mode ? 4 : 2); !} month_actions += 1
go-to: post_event

@navigation_return_main
on-arrival: {! AnatolianCardActions.back(this); !}
go-to: main.main_easy if difficulty < 0; main if difficulty >= 0
